WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.860
The last time we were together,

2
00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.970
you were growing a garden.

3
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:06.110
How is the garden?

4
00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.663
Well, the garden is garbage.

5
00:00:09.819 --> 00:00:12.410
It was great last year.

6
00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:16.220
And then I got victimized

7
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.633
by a pack of raccoons.

8
00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:22.880
There were six raccoons 'cause I have my cameras,

9
00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.340
and I was like, "What is going on?"

10
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.480
'Cause I would go outside in the morning to water my garden

11
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:30.100
and there would just be things, plants all over the place.

12
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.280
Holes, dirt everywhere.

13
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.560
I was like, "What happened in here?"

14
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.980
It looked like a human being came

15
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.450
and dug everything out.

16
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:42.020
And I looked at my cameras and it was six huge raccoons

17
00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.280
flying across the lawn, going to the beds

18
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.870
and they didn't even eat the vegetables.

19
00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:49.670
That was the worst part.

20
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.607
They just ransacked it for pleasure?

21
00:00:52.607 --> 00:00:54.530
Yeah, well, I dunno what their end game is

22
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:55.740
and I'm still trying to figure it out.

23
00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.040
They just threw away

24
00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:00.850
all these beautiful organic hand grown vegetables

25
00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.470
and they just didn't eat them.

26
00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:03.810
And I'm assuming they buried

27
00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:08.070
some valuables or something in there.

28
00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.680
Well, you tell those raccoons

29
00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.230
that they better stay away from your garden

30
00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:13.960
or I'm gonna come and kick their, you know what's!

31
00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.850
Well, I will and I'm sure they will listen to me

32
00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:19.540
but I am sprouting sprouts right now.

33
00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.160
I am doing seedlings.

34
00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.990
I am not giving a up.

35
00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:24.080
I will prevail.

36
00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.290
Don't give up.

37
00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.290
Don't give up.

38
00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.623
And maybe a little fencing.

39
00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.883
Oh, you think I haven't thought of fencing.

40
00:01:33.804 --> 00:01:35.097
(Drew laughs)

41
00:01:35.097 --> 00:01:38.810
I put fence in the beds around the edges

42
00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:42.030
and I covered it in sheets

43
00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:45.330
and bird wires.

44
00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:46.990
They ripped it all out.

45
00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:48.980
They're very strong.

46
00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:52.290
Now I would love to ask you, which is so crazy.

47
00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.280
This is the third time before we get to Dollface.

48
00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:57.040
This is the third time we've done this show together

49
00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:00.388
and I never talked to you about doing Sex and the City.

50
00:02:00.388 --> 00:02:01.388
Oh my God.

51
00:02:02.523 --> 00:02:04.228
I love you in Sex and the City.

52
00:02:04.228 --> 00:02:05.061
Thank you.

53
00:02:05.061 --> 00:02:08.400
I love you in that episode so much.

54
00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.920
What was it like, give me fly on the wall?

55
00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.330
What was that like?

56
00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:13.450
Well, it was amazing.

57
00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:18.063
First of all, I was, I think 13, maybe 14.

58
00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:19.970
Oh God, look.

59
00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:21.540
Look at the look on your face.

60
00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.670
Look at the look on your face.

61
00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:25.860
I was a fetus.

62
00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.450 line:15%
I didn't know what the show was.

63
00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.820 line:15%
My mom and I took a cab from Penn station to my audition.

64
00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:33.550 line:15%
I was like, "This is a weird show.

65
00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:34.680
It has a word sex in it.

66
00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.030
I don't know, whatever."

67
00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.740
And when it was time for the show to air,

68
00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.000
we didn't have cable.

69
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.150
So my mom got cable and all my little girl friends came over

70
00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:45.780
with their moms to watch the show.

71
00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:48.340
And if you remember

72
00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:52.770
that this is one of the most messed up episodes

73
00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.123
of Sex and the City.

74
00:02:55.123 --> 00:02:58.123
Because my mom ran to turn it off.

75
00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.060
Everyone's mom was like, "Oh."

76
00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:01.940
It was crazy.

77
00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.770
But at the time I just thought it was cool

78
00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:06.010
and doing some TV show that I had never heard of.

79
00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:08.310
And I got to wear pretty outfits and have my hair done.

80
00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:10.300
And everyone was really nice to me.

81
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.325
And be so sassy, yes.

82
00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:15.440
And Michael Patrick King was there

83
00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:18.220
who I later worked for who created Two Broke Girls.

84
00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.927
Yes.
So that was interesting.

85
00:03:20.769 --> 00:03:22.315
(audience claps)

86
00:03:22.315 --> 00:03:23.464
Full circle.

87
00:03:23.464 --> 00:03:26.857
I mean, that is an origin story for sure.

88
00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.630
Okay, tell me about Dollface.

89
00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.720
This is the second season of this show.

90
00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:37.350
What is it about Dollface that speaks to you

91
00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:40.040
or that you get to do differently?

92
00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:45.040 line:15%
Well, I am a real sucker for feel good stuff.

93
00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.360 line:15%
I've done a lot of fun, amazing things

94
00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.490 line:15%
but there is just something about the warmth

95
00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.190 line:15%
and coziness of this show.

96
00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:57.190
And the cast is just the most incredible group of women.

97
00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.940
And I love them so much.

98
00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:02.170
Brenda Song is one of my best friends in the world

99
00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.920
and that chemistry really translates.

100
00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.130
I mean, you can't fake that kind of thing.

101
00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.010
So that's really fun for people to watch.

102
00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:13.873
And yeah, season one left off with my character Jules,

103
00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:17.260
ruining someone's wedding

104
00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:22.550
and then exposing Brenda Song's character,

105
00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:27.273
Madison's boyfriend as being the husband of my boss.

106
00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:31.160
So I blew everything up essentially.

107
00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:34.150
And this season begins with me going into the office

108
00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.240
for the first time after the pandemic,

109
00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.990
assuming that I'm going to be fired,

110
00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.993
but instead I get promoted.

111
00:04:40.878 --> 00:04:44.040
(audience cheers)
(Kat laughs)

112
00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.090
Well, if anybody tries to mess with your wedding

113
00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.500
you call me and I will meet them in a dark alley

114
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.880
at a very late hour and I will take them down.

115
00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.660
I will give them the raccoon treatment.

116
00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.630
Thank you so much.

117
00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.670
I was thinking of having a raccoon officiate.

118
00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.490
So we'll see how that goes.

119
00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:01.510
Thank you so much, Kat.

120
00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.560
I love you so much.

121
00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:07.100
Season two of Dollface is available now on Hulu.

122
00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.668
And we will be right back.

123
00:05:09.668 --> 00:05:12.251 line:15%
(upbeat music)

124
